----------------------------------------------------------------------------

	Some scripts to run GRAZING_9

----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  In this directory you find some script to run GRAZING_9 for some specific
  task:

  -  fus_com     to calculate a fusion excitation function
  -  bd_com      to calculate a barrier distribution
  -  nipb_wil    to calculate wilshinski plots for a given N and z

  Before using them they must be modifyed to satisfy the local setting.


  NB. Before running the scripts (they use default parameters) it
      is reccomended to run first the program in the interacticve mode to
      familiarize with the kind of input and the different options the 
      program offers to overule the default parameters.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------  

 In the same directory you find also a file .inp

  pg_fus.inp

 that you may use to plot the fusion excitation function and the barrier
 distribution you calculated with the scripts above. This command file
 is for the plotting program GZP2, provided in the same distribution, that
 is based on the PGPLOT library.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------  
